    "interpretation": "K1120 confirmed: residualized NFCI (orthogonal to VIX+MOVE) still carries TLT-specific independent information in post-2022 regime even after controlling for cross-asset IV (VIX+MOVE) in baseline. Common-shock confound rejected.",
