  "paper4_narrative_impact": "Paper 4 TLT regime caveat survives: residualized NFCI is genuinely independent of VIX+MOVE during rate-hike regime. K1120 conclusion intact. Caveat: a substantial fraction of K1120's raw NFCI signal comes from the VIX-correlated component of NFCI; the truly orthogonal TLT-specific component is the smaller residual portion. Paper 4 should explicitly note that ~71% of NFCI variance overlaps with VIX+MOVE.",
  "diagnostic_negative_resid_vs_move": "Diagnostic: post-2022 M4_resid vs M3_MOVE = -6.191 (strongly negative). Interpretation: this test CHANGES baseline composition (drops MOVE, adds NFCI_resid + STLFSI). The negative sign means NFCI_resid + STLFSI alone (no MOVE in baseline) is WORSE than MOVE alone \u2014 confirming that the VIX-correlated component of raw NFCI is what gave K1120's M4 most of its lift, NOT the orthogonal residual. The clean common-shock test is M4_resid_full vs M3_VIX_MOVE (=+9.729) which keeps both VIX+MOVE in both baselines.",
  "self_check_DM_t_above_6": "Preamble rule #5: primary DM-t = +9.729 > 6 triggers self-check. Verification: (a) Pre-2022 same test = -2.364 (opposite sign / NS), so the result is regime-specific not algorithmic bias. (b) Reinforced by independent secondary test M4_resid_full vs M3_VIX_MOVE_STLFSI (adds NFCI_resid after STLFSI controlled) = +8.431 also strongly positive in post-2022. (c) STLFSI alone vs VIX+MOVE = +5.157 shows STLFSI also contributes independently \u2014 both FinStress components are adding info beyond VIX+MOVE in the rate-hike regime. (d) The K1120 raw +5.675 is reproduced as M4_raw vs M3_MOVE = +4.932 (close match, residual difference due to daily-ffill aggregation vs K1120 weekly mean). (e) NO LOOKAHEAD: rolling residualization uses days [t-252, t-1] (exclusive of t); plus all NFCI values shifted by 2 weeks before use in forecast; rolling fit data published > 2 weeks before forecast date. The high t-stat reflects the genuine size of the post-2022 NFCI_resid signal in the small (n=103) regime sample, not lookahead. Treat primary +9.729 as upper bound \u2014 interpret with the smaller M4_raw vs M3_MOVE = +4.932 as more conservative effect-size anchor for the 'NFCI improves on MOVE alone' framing.",
  "finished_utc": "2026-04-13T21:05:57.149922Z"
}